{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Acute-angled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is inscribed in a circle with center at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b893697555515b2dd8c8364a228dbd488f2de011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel \\frown {AB} = 120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337539bd8e3d871b53802b618c33a8e29bf403c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel \\frown {BC} = 72^\\circ$\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>A point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is taken in minor arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/9/db9d3474e139c8e1c2f5902c3cb42d7e47fa7e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OE$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. Then the ratio of the magnitudes of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b86b755b2691045d201a82d23eebc59a1e88836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OBE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5862947b38a495ec9be80e5b9c7582de6cf0d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08efe4976b02cd3a330073745f54f66dcd31a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{5}{18}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{9}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"376\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff1fba59b092720a0292bb75a80014ebc3712da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(circle((0,0),1)); dot((-1,0)); pair A=(-1,0),B=(0.5,0.866),C=(0.978,-0.208),O=(0,0),E=(-0.105,-0.995); label(&quot;A&quot;,(-1,0),W); dot((0.5,0.866)); label(&quot;B&quot;,(0.5,0.866),NE); dot((0.978,-0.208)); label(&quot;C&quot;,(0.978,-0.208),SE); dot((0,0)); label(&quot;O&quot;,(0,0),NE); dot(E); label(&quot;E&quot;,E,S); draw(A--B--C--A); draw(E--O);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"238\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b893697555515b2dd8c8364a228dbd488f2de011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel \\frown {AB} = 120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337539bd8e3d871b53802b618c33a8e29bf403c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel \\frown {BC} = 72^\\circ$\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c1d41770df33ddd5590abb271e8e54cba0b824.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\stackrel \\frown {AC} = 168^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"21\" />.  Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbbdc4b83b4c947098e1137d39af9df0aa53fbaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OA = OC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa8f2d724e7b6439a0de3e65f58c6cd3ded96b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OE \\perp AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/4854c43ffc6cbd110e747713863df630ab8da635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AOE = \\angle COE = 84^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"184\" height=\"13\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/b/69b80e6b19c4468096d296402d5d7fed8156d141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOC = 72^\\circ$\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/d/97d8dbe6daf51b9a64bf99b9d8a54f7bebb6f3bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BOE = 156^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />.  Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db831a2fe303c3b418680d4c6b3ef15cb86ef70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BOE$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Isosceles_triangle\" title=\"Isosceles triangle\">isosceles triangle</a>, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/d/27d149a7516fd93dbfa4ca7119457d2a6fe71567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OBE = 12^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed2f5db8406d3373fb5cc18373c5cf21e3b0c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 72 = 36^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"172\" height=\"37\" />, the ratio of the magnitudes of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b86b755b2691045d201a82d23eebc59a1e88836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle OBE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5862947b38a495ec9be80e5b9c7582de6cf0d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e78a4802c70400e4eb172cb75f9db2b411b33608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{36} = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#1